  Rules:  use these instead of emoji for UI chrome; size via IconSize* tokens (12/14/16/20/28);
          colour comes from Foreground (inherits — never hardcode).
  More legacy geometries live in App.axaml (search_regular, play_regular, pause_regular, ...).
  The *_regular / icons_* keys at the bottom were referenced by Views but never defined.
-->
